==Latin==

===Etymology===
Proposed by some to be for ''*prōpatrius'', thus from {{m|la|prō-}} + {{m|la|pater}}, meaning ''"from one's forefathers"''. Confer with Ancient Greek {{m|grc|προπάτωρ||forefather}}.

